'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">支付宝与OPPO达成智能体跨端互联，阿宝与小布实现双向联动</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI旗下ChatGPT正式重返欧洲WhatsApp平台并搭载GPT-5.5模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 研发首款无屏幕智能音箱，旨在打造家庭 AI 陪伴助手</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">豆包与通义千问下线智能体功能，AI拟人化互动服务新规今日正式施行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/66cd75429d609f00588dd069f3423a85.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动旗下豆包与阿里巴巴旗下通义千问于今日正式下线智能体功能，用户无法新建或调用已有智能体。此次调整与《人工智能拟人化互动服务管理暂行办法》的施行日期重合，该办法由五部门联合发布，是我国首部针对AI拟人化互动服务的专门立法。新规明确监管边界，重点聚焦具有人格设定和情感陪伴属性的AI产品，如虚拟伴侣、虚拟亲属及自定义角色类智能体。提供智能客服、知识问答、工作助手等不涉及持续性情感互动的工具型服务不受影响。豆包官方确认，其基础AI功能如问答、文案生成及AI绘画等能力维持正常。此外，新规要求相关服务必须进行安全评估与算法备案，并推动人工智能沙箱安全服务平台建设。此举标志着我国AI拟人化互动服务进入有法可依的规范化管理阶段，明确了工具型AI与情感陪伴型AI的监管差异。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">甲骨文发布Oracle AI Agent Studio平台，支持无代码开发代理式应用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f4be0b307adb96e5fb09c3aaea4e94a0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">甲骨文于7月14日正式发布AI原生代理应用开发平台Oracle AI Agent Studio for Fusion Applications，旨在助力企业构建并运行Fusion Agentic Applications。该平台核心亮点在于支持无代码、低代码及专业代码等多种开发模式，满足不同技术背景开发者的需求。平台引入AI Studio Skill，全面兼容Visual Studio Code、命令行工具及Git等现代化开发环境。此外，该平台支持接入OpenAI Codex与Claude Code等AI编程助手，通过智能辅助显著提升代码编写效率与质量。对于企业而言，此平台不仅能加速数字化转型进程，还通过代理式应用提升业务响应速度与灵活性，为企业在复杂市场竞争中提供更高效的智能应用构建方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">支付宝与OPPO达成智能体跨端互联，阿宝与小布实现双向联动</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2a9f94504e4501cb6d50eec6d1832c41.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">支付宝与OPPO正式达成智能体跨端互联合作，旗下AI智能体“阿宝”与OPPO手机智能助手“小布”实现双向联动。用户无需打开支付宝App，通过小布语音助手即可向阿宝派发任务，大幅缩短交互链路。首期合作已接入近200项生活服务，涵盖观影、点餐、出行及社保、公积金等高频场景。技术上，阿宝在后台自动匹配服务并代办前置流程，支付与授权环节保留手动确认，保障资金隐私。该功能要求ColorOS 16、小布助手12.8.4、支付宝12.12.1及16.1.8以上意图执行框架。此次合作通过多维风控和端云解耦架构，实现了端侧AI助手与大厂服务生态的深度融合，为AI Agent跨平台生态建设提供了行业范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI旗下ChatGPT正式重返欧洲WhatsApp平台并搭载GPT-5.5模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d8050676c877408762baaa7c6e1e93f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">2026年7月13日，ChatGPT正式重返欧洲WhatsApp平台，服务覆盖欧洲经济区（EEA）的27个欧盟成员国及列支敦士登、冰岛和挪威。此次回归源于欧盟委员会针对Meta此前垄断行为下达的“临时措施”指令。欧洲用户现可通过官方电话1-800-CHATGPT直接互动，无需注册即可使用多模态功能，包括文本、图片上传、语音留言及图像生成。该机器人后台运行GPT-5.5模型，图像生成任务疑似由全新的gpt-image-2模型处理。用户可选择关联WhatsApp与ChatGPT账号以同步历史记录。此前，Meta曾于2026年1月15日禁止第三方AI服务接入，此次强制开放标志着欧盟在打破社交平台AI围墙方面取得进展。OpenAI目前正同步推进ChatGPT在韩国Kakao Messenger及Viber等平台的布局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 研发首款无屏幕智能音箱，旨在打造家庭 AI 陪伴助手</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ad388b8cf2ea4d52b0b880f7926cc7f3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 正在研发其首款硬件产品——一款可移动、无屏幕的智能音箱，旨在将其 ChatGPT 能力实体化，作为家庭 AI 陪伴助手使用。该设备具备智能家居控制、多媒体播放、信息收发及问答交互功能。目前 OpenAI 硬件部门正同步推进约五款产品研发，该音箱被视为切入硬件市场的首发产品。针对苹果公司提起的商业秘密侵权诉讼，OpenAI 回应称其产品与苹果现有设备有显著区别，否认侵权指控。受此法律纠纷影响，该产品原定于 2026 年内发布、2027 年正式上市的时间表存在不确定性。该产品的推出标志着 OpenAI 试图将 LLM 技术深度融入家庭生态，为用户提供更直观的交互体验，并有望推动智能家居行业的技术演进。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
